# The released binaries in bin/ are committed on purpose. Shipping them is
# what makes installing this plugin free of any toolchain: no Python, no Go,
# no network. Do not add bin/ here.

*.test
coverage.out

# The plugin's own runtime files. This repository is recorded by the plugin it
# contains, so these land in its root as a consequence of dogfooding rather
# than being part of it -- a lock file was already sitting here untracked.
# Users who opt their own projects in need the same three lines.
.tracedoc-on
.tracedoc-state.json
.tracedoc.lock
*-tracedoc*.md
